hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"18494","Waki narrated to us, he said: Ibn Abi Khalid narrated to us, from Qays ibn Abi Hazim, from his father who said: The Prophet (peace and blessings of Allah be upon him) saw me while he was preaching and I was in the sun, so he ordered me and I moved to the shade."
